<%doc>

=head1 NAME

population_exists.mas - a mason component for displaying message 
when a user tries to submit a population name the same with an existing one...
=AUTHOR

Isaak Y Tecle (iyt2@cornell.edu)

=cut

</%doc>

<%args>

$name
$guide

</%args>

<%perl>
 my $message = qq | <p> 資料庫中似乎已存在群體(It appears that a population) <b>$name</b>。若要繼續為新群體載入 QTL 資料，請嘗試使用不同的群體名稱(To continue loading QTL data for a new population, try with a different population name)。</p>
                         
                  <p>如果您嘗試為現有群體載入更多資料或變更資料，請聯繫我們(If you are trying to load more or change data to an exising population contact us)。</p>

                 <p>請<a href="javascript:history.go(-1)">返回(back)</a>並嘗試使用不同的名稱，或者如果您持續遇到問題，請聯繫我們(and try to use a different name or if you keep having problem with it contact us)。</p>
                 |;



</%perl>

<& /page/page_title.mas, title => 'QTL 群體(QTL population)' &>
<&| /page/info_section.mas, title => '', subtitle => $guide &>
  <% $message %>  
</&>
